[Lem LastOne of arXiv:2411.13926, 'Random walks on random walks:\\ non-perturbative results in high dimensions'] Let $Y_k^{(1)} \in I^{(1)}$ be the random lift of $y_k \in I^{(k)}$. Then 
\begin{align}
\ensuremath{\mathbb{P}}(Y_k^{(1)}=x) = P^{RW}(X \in x \;|\;  D_k), \quad x \in  I^{(1)}.
\end{align}

