  for any $x \in M$ and $t \in (0,\infty)$,
  \begin{equation}
    \hat{P}_{\diag(x)}\!
    \left(
      \varlimsup_{r \downarrow 0}
      \frac{\Pi_t(B(x,r))}{\varphi_2(r) \log \log (1/r)}
      \geq c
    \right)
    =1.
  \end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

