body:
[Corollary 34 of arXiv:2607.21374, 'Local structure at the maximum and sharp persistence asymptotics of rough fractional Brown'] Let \(m_H:=\lceil1/H\rceil\).  Then, for every \(T>0\),
\begin{equation}
  \mathcal Z(2^{-1/H}T)
  \leq p_*^{-m_H}\mathcal Z(T)

\end{equation}
and, for \(A\geq0\),
\begin{equation}
  \sup_{a>0}\widehat{\PP}_a(V_a>A)
  \leq p_*^{-m_H}e^{-A/2}.

\end{equation}

