    Let $L_0$, $L_1$ be the quantum length of the outer and inner boundary, respectively, and $\langle \cdot \rangle^\gamma_{\MA}$ be the integration with respect to $\MA$ with certain $\gamma\in(0, 2)$. We have
    \begin{equation*}
