[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2604.18871, 'Quantitative approximation of the Vlasov(--Fokker--Planck)--Navier--Stokes system by stoch'] Let $p\geq 1$ and $(u, F)$ be any bounded weak solution of \eqref{eq:PDE}.
If $M_{p+d(p-1)}(F^\circ)< +\infty$, then
\begin{equation*}
\sup_{t\in [0,T]} \lVert m_{0}(F_{t})\rVert_{L^p_{x}} + \sup_{t\in [0,T]} \lVert m_{1}(F_{t})\rVert_{L^p_{x}} <\infty .
\end{equation*}

