odd and $R_2$ even,
\begin{equation}

\sum_{r=0}^{R_1}(-1)^r\sigma_r(A,B)
\leq
1_{\{A=B\}}
\leq
\sum_{r=0}^{R_2}(-1)^r\tau_r(A,B).
\end{equation}

