and hence $\left\|\Dop_i\right\|_{\Leb^\infty\to \Leb^\infty}\leq 1$. Iterating across $i\in J$ gives $\left\|\Dop_J\right\|_{\Leb^\infty\to \Leb^\infty}\leq 1$. Conversely, the equality is attained since $\left\|\Dop_J \chi_J\right\|_{\Leb^\infty}=1=","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:88529559f626e50f469ef3a12c08630d6c0ad169e93b78241372e42fe078cdf7","revision_digest":"sha256:20217ab6533f891e8ca0a1499493c89571fd02b6d88318ead1c8b49e1a4ce21a","source_id":"arxiv:2606.14876","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

