[Lemma lem:abstract-local-window-nullity of arXiv:2608.02459, 'Response Calculus for Spectral Simplicity\\ and Joint Eigenvalue Densities'] Let $\mu_0$ be admissible, and let $H_N\subsetH_{\mathrm{reg}}$ be $N$-dimensional with
