        \mathcal E^*(\Pi_0)-\mathcal E^*(\Pi_1)&=\lim_{n\to \infty} n^{-1}\left(\mathsf{Ent}(\Pi^{1,n}_0\mid \gamma^{\otimes_{i=1}^n})-\mathsf{Ent}(\Pi^{1,n}_1\mid \gamma^{\otimes_{i=1}^n}) \right)
