[Lem nah-an-opt of arXiv:2503.22334, 'Probabilistic analysis of optimal multi-pivot QuickSort'] The additional cost of the algorithm compared to always using $t_{\mathrm{opt}}$ is of sub-polynomial order:
    \begin{equation*}
    \rho_n := \Ek{P_n} - \Ek*{\sum_{i=0}^K I^{(i)}_n h_{\mathrm{opt}}(i)} = \mathrm{O}\kl*{(\log n)^2}
    \end{equation*}

