Recalling the definition of $Q_{j,\ell,m}$, we see that all terms on the left-hand side of (equation eq:qjellsmall of the paper) have the following form
\begin{align*}
    e^{-\frac{z^2}{2n}}\frac{1}{n^{\alpha}}
    \left(\frac{z}{\sqrt{n}}\right)^{\beta}.
\end{align*}
Applying (equation eq:simple-ineq of the paper) we get,
for every $\beta \ge 0$,
\begin{align*}
    e^{-\frac{z^2}{2 n}}\frac{1}{n^{\alpha}}
    \left(\frac{z}{\sqrt{n}}\right)^{\beta}
=
    O\left(\frac{1}{n^{\alpha}}\right).
\end{align*}
