[Lem l:300.3.10 of arXiv:2602.21277, 'A Limit in Law for the Cover Time and Last Visited Vertex of Wired Planar Domains'] For any fixed $u \geq 0$, 
	\begin{equation}
		\frac{|{\mathbf W}_n(u) \setminus {\mathbf W}_n^{k,\epsilon}(u)|}{\sqrt{n}} \overset{\mathbb{P}}{\longrightarrow}0,  
	\end{equation}
	in the limit as $n \to \infty$, followed by $k \to \infty$ and finally $\epsilon \to 0$.

