[Corollary cor:mgf_bound of arXiv:2609.01581, 'Concentration of additive functionals of Stratonovich-type'] For $A\in\{\rho,J\}$, $k\in\mathbb{R}$, $t\ge0$, and any initial law $\nu\ll\mu$,
