[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2608.04644, 'Khinchin's and Chung's Laws of the Iterated Logarithm at Time Zero for the Linear Stochast'] Recall that $H$ is defined in \eqref{def:H}. Suppose that Condition \ref{hypo}  holds  and that $H<1$.
