Since $q_n=xt+O(1)$, these estimates give
\begin{equation}
aq_n=x+o(1),
\qquad
m\lambda=o(1),
\qquad
\theta=\frac1t+O(t^{-2}).
\end{equation}
In particular,
\begin{equation}
m\theta^2\longrightarrow1,
\qquad
q_n\theta\longrightarrow x,
\qquad
