[Lem 28 (Interior enlargement) of arXiv:2609.02398, '\textbf{Convex Order Comparisons for Sub-Gamma Random Variables}'] Let $Y$ be bounded and centered. Suppose $\E[Y^2] < 1$ and
\begin{align}
    \log M_Y(\lambda) < \frac{\lambda^2}{2(1 - a|\lambda|)}
    \qquad (0 < |\lambda| < 1/a).

\end{align}
Then $rY \in \SG(1,a)$ for some $r > 1$.

