\hat{F}_{I}(D_{m}\tilde{L})=(\log S(B))^{I}E_{1,m+1},
\end{equation}
where $(\cdot)^{I}$ denotes the coefficient of a tensor series over
$\mathbb{C}^{d}$ with respect to the monomial ${\rm e}_{i_{1}}\otimes\cdots\otimes{\rm e}_{i_{m}}.$ (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

