In particular, Theorem (thm: skewBM meeting of the paper) (i)-(ii) hold by Theorems (thm:U_process of the paper) and (thm:U_process- of the paper).

[Corollary 28 of arXiv:2608.02927, 'Thinning Operation via the Poisson-F\"ollmer Process'] Let $X$ have density $f$ with respect to $\pi_{T}.$ If $H(T_{a}(X) |\pi_{aT}) < \infty$ for some $a \in (0,1],$ then
