\(2^{M_i}\eps_i\le r_0<2^{M_i+1}\eps_i\). Using \eqref{k2:eq:volume-estimates}, we have
\begin{align}
 \int_{\widetilde X}\tau_i^{\delta-4}\omega_{\eps_i}^n
 &=
 \int_{\{d<2\eps_i\}}\tau_i^{\delta-4}\omega_{\eps_i}^n
 +\sum_{m=1}^{M_i}
