[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2510.20492, 'Heterochromatic two-arm probabilities for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] For any $d\ge 3$ and $v\neq w\in \widetilde{\mathbb{Z}}^d$ with $|v-w|\ge 10d$, 
	\begin{equation}
		\mathbb{K}_{\{v,w\}}(v,w)\asymp |v-w|^{2-d}.
	\end{equation}

